# GNOME Software on this image is a Flatpak app store.  The tree has no
# app-admin/packagekit at all, so there is no PackageKit/Portage backend to
# build; the PyQt package manager remains the Portage UI.
# -firmware keeps fwupd (and its systemd-leaning stack) out of the live image.
gnome-extra/gnome-software sysprof flatpak -firmware
